            "review_title": "Review at Luna Sushi",
            "review_text": "Hang N\n34 contributions\n0\nBest Sushi in town - Highly recommended\nJan 2025 • Family\nI recently had the pleasure of dining at Luna Sushi, and I have to say, it's an absolute gem! The sashimi was incredibly fresh, each piece practically melting in my mouth. The restaurant itself is cozy and welcoming. I was beyond impressed with the quality and variety of their offerings. They also offer delivery, which means I can enjoy their delicious sushi from the comfort of my own home! Highly recommended to anyone who appreciates top-notch sushi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 11, 2025",
