            "review_title": "Review at Luna Sushi",
            "review_text": "keng wah w\nSri Kembangan, Malaysia577 contributions\n0\nA family run japanese meals, worth the try\nOct 2024 • Business\nGet in to some food, should we. \n\nThe location if located at D1 of HCMC, is run by a family couple, been operation for 10years. When you enter is kinda like entering a small Japanese house. \n\nHospitaly the couple offering is stunning, very humble couple, just when you don't know what to orders, just tells him ' Omakase' the couple will do the reast till you says stop. \nSeating capacity is around 15-18 pax.\nWashroom is located at top floor.\nIs all walking staircase. \n\nNow here comes the review of the food:\nFreash from overseas, even the Japanese wine Sake is important.\n\nThe restaurant is not like any other big franchise chain outlet, so if you wants to support local small business, is worth the try. \n\nOperations time: \nDaily \n10.00am - 3.00pm\n4.00pm - 9.40pm\nContact number: +84 946600108\nAddress: 14a, Hoa My. Dakao Q1, Ho Chi Minh \n\nMade a table reservation, as the sitting capacity is limited.\nRead more\nWritten October 16, 2024",
